        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/9de053/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-10-13T17:52:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I think this topic (or a similar one) should be stickied once consensus is reached (or an official ruling obtained).&nbsp; As it is, I'm finding it impossible to locate the clarification I wanted, which is what happens when 5-6 damage is dealt to Wraith with Shielding Winds in play and Stealth activated (once).&nbsp; For today I will play it as \"stealth applies first due to card play order, so Shielding Winds never applies\", but it'd be nice to know for sure.&nbsp; Spiff's compilation could really stand to have an official Christopher-approved clarification of this very common interaction.</p>",
